# nanopb size constraints for moon_companion.proto
#
# Everything must fit in a single GATT notification (up to 244 bytes on a
# 247-byte MTU link). Tier 2 (updates + HTTP proxy) will need larger
# payloads — those travel on an L2CAP CoC side-channel, not this proto.

# ── Envelopes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*MoonRequest.auth_token       max_size:16
*PairRequest.flipper_name     max_size:32
*PairResponse.auth_token      max_size:16
*PairResponse.phone_name      max_size:32

# ── Position ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*PositionData.source_id       max_size:8

# ── Time ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*TimeData.tz_name             max_size:48

# ── Notifications ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*SendNotificationRequest.title  max_size:64
*SendNotificationRequest.body   max_size:160
*SendNotificationRequest.tag    max_size:32

# ── Bulk transfer side-channel (Phase 3) ──────────────────────────────
*OpenBulkChannelRequest.name      max_size:64
*OpenBulkChannelResponse.session_id  max_size:8
*CloseBulkChannelRequest.session_id  max_size:8

# ── Tier 2 (Phase 2+) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Capped aggressively — these are stubs for now. Will revisit when we
# design the L2CAP CoC side-channel for large payloads.
*AppVersion.appid             max_size:32
*AppVersion.version           max_size:16
*AvailableUpdate.appid        max_size:32
*AvailableUpdate.new_version  max_size:16
*AvailableUpdate.source_url   max_size:128
*ListAppUpdatesRequest.installed  max_count:8
*UpdateList.updates               max_count:8
*DownloadAppRequest.appid         max_size:32
*DownloadAppRequest.source_url    max_size:128
*CheckFirmwareUpdateRequest.current_version  max_size:16
*HttpHeader.key               max_size:32
*HttpHeader.value             max_size:128
*HttpGetRequest.url           max_size:128
*HttpGetRequest.headers       max_count:4
*HttpPostRequest.url          max_size:128
*HttpPostRequest.headers      max_count:4
*HttpPostRequest.body         max_size:128
*HttpResponse.headers         max_count:4
*HttpResponse.body            max_size:128
